{"id": "q0061", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2317558360, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "67ad139c11ad192120e00f1f4cc28f36ec4dc2a78471efa94476f5caf342cabc", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 0, "query": "Steve put together a puzzle that took 10 hours of hard work to complete. Anna put together the same puzzle in 2 hours more than half Steve's time. How long did it take Anna to finish the difficult puzzle?\n\nShow your work and end with the final numeric answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0061.wav", "input_sha256": "b3f94b44ab05c3e5dfa5ebd67169ff55dacd59b6f800da17fc4bae6f03346bf3", "input_samples": 267000, "input_s": 16.688, "n_real_chunks": 17, "score": 0.2059, "act": 0.9991, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Steve’s time: 10 hours Half of Steve’s time: \\[ 10 \\div 2 = 5 \\] Anna took 2 hours more than half of Steve’s time: \\[ 5 + 2 = 7 \\] So Anna took 7 hours. Final answer: 7", "expert_answer": "Steve’s time: **10 hours**\n\nHalf of Steve’s time:\n\n\\[\n10 \\div 2 = 5\n\\]\n\nAnna took **2 hours more** than half of Steve’s time:\n\n\\[\n5 + 2 = 7\n\\]\n\nSo Anna took **7 hours**.\n\n**Final answer: 7**", "transcript": "Steve put together a puzzle that took 10 hours of hard work to complete. Anna put together the same puzzle in 2 hours more than half Steve's time. How long did it take Anna to finish the difficult puzzle? Show your work and end with the final numeric answer.\n", "asr_s": 1.53, "expert_s": 2.29, "expert_input_samples": 267000, "expert_input_s": 16.688, "expert_input_sha256": "b3f94b44ab05c3e5dfa5ebd67169ff55dacd59b6f800da17fc4bae6f03346bf3", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 2.69, "relay_synth_ms": 9810, "onset_chunk": 16, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 1, "feed_lag_max_