{"id": "q0074", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3813861270, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "67ad139c11ad192120e00f1f4cc28f36ec4dc2a78471efa94476f5caf342cabc", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 0, "query": "A company produces chocolate in bars. In one day, it can produce 5000 bars. The company sells all the produced bars for $2 per bar. How much money will the company receive for selling produced chocolate bars during two weeks?\n\nShow your work and end with the final numeric answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0074.wav", "input_sha256": "c8466ed485fce9e5d445ba4ff8d9bd6a718173c992aeac6535dd430d530c3b50", "input_samples": 293600, "input_s": 18.35, "n_real_chunks": 19, "score": 0.2029, "act": 0.998, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Work: Bars produced per day: 5,000 , Selling price per bar: $2 , Money received per day: 5,000 × $2 = $10,000 , Two weeks = 14 days , Money received in 14 days: $10,000 × 14 = $140,000 Final answer: $140,000", "expert_answer": "Work:\n\n- Bars produced per day: **5,000**\n- Selling price per bar: **$2**\n- Money received per day:  \n  **5,000 × $2 = $10,000**\n- Two weeks = **14 days**\n- Money received in 14 days:  \n  **$10,000 × 14 = $140,000**\n\n**Final answer: $140,000**", "transcript": "A company produces chocolate in bars. In one day it can produce 5,000 bars. The company sells all the produced bars for $2 per bar. How much money will the company receive for selling produced chocolate bars during two weeks? Show your work and end with a final numeric answer.\n", "asr_s": 0.88, "expert_s": 2.42, "expert_input_samples": 293600, "expert_input_s": 18.35, "expert_input_sha256": "c8466ed485fce9e5d445ba4ff8d9bd6a718173c992aeac6535dd430d530c3b50", "expert_timed_out": false, 