{"id": "q0110", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3014127166, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "67ad139c11ad192120e00f1f4cc28f36ec4dc2a78471efa94476f5caf342cabc", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 0, "query": "Solve for the positive value of $x$ such that $\\sqrt[3]{x^2 - 4x + 4} = 16$.\n\nSolve and give the final answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0110.wav", "input_sha256": "19fa5ec4d5cb0dc8c0d6977509859a2e72cace78148b805f1f64d03e0f0e37ef", "input_samples": 124000, "input_s": 7.75, "n_real_chunks": 8, "score": 0.5796, "act": 0.9984, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "There is no positive value of \\(x\\) for the equation as written. If interpreted as: \\[ \\sqrt{3-4x}+4=16 \\] then: \\[ \\sqrt{3-4x}=12 \\] \\[ 3-4x=144 \\] \\[ -4x=141 \\] \\[ x=-\\frac{141}{4} \\] This is negative, so no positive solution exists.", "expert_answer": "There is **no positive value of \\(x\\)** for the equation as written.\n\nIf interpreted as:\n\n\\[\n\\sqrt{3-4x}+4=16\n\\]\n\nthen:\n\n\\[\n\\sqrt{3-4x}=12\n\\]\n\n\\[\n3-4x=144\n\\]\n\n\\[\n-4x=141\n\\]\n\n\\[\nx=-\\frac{141}{4}\n\\]\n\nThis is negative, so **no positive solution exists**.", "transcript": "Solve for the positive value of x such that square root 3 minus 4x plus 4 equals 16. Solve and give the final answer.\n", "asr_s": 0.64, "expert_s": 5.29, "expert_input_samples": 124000, "expert_input_s": 7.75, "expert_input_sha256": "19fa5ec4d5cb0dc8c0d6977509859a2e72cace78148b805f1f64d03e0f0e37ef", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 0.0, "relay_synth_ms": 21515, "onset_chunk": 7, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 30, "feed_lag_max_ms": 860, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 3794, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0110_always_relay.wav", "sha25