{"id": "q0164", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 4220239072, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "67ad139c11ad192120e00f1f4cc28f36ec4dc2a78471efa94476f5caf342cabc", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 0, "query": "Finding all the real roots of the equation $\\sqrt{x^2+x+1}+\\sqrt{2 x^2+x+5}=\\sqrt{x^2-3 x+13}$. Return the answer as a list with ascending order.\n\nA. [0.2807764064, -1.7807764064]\nB. [-2.2807764064, 1.2807764064]\nC. [1.7807764064, -0.2807764064]\nD. []\nE. [-1.2807764064, 2.2807764064]\nF. [0.2807764064, 2.7807764064]\nG. [-3.7807764064, 0.7807764064]\nH. [-0.2807764064, 1.7807764064]\nI. [-1.7807764064, 0.2807764064]\nJ. [0, 2]\n\nAnswer with the correct option letter and its content.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0164.wav", "input_sha256": "c04299adfe3bfefe9ceb2ba67213992c935c97066e07c1e850ce2f87e24b776e", "input_samples": 953600, "input_s": 59.6, "n_real_chunks": 60, "score": 0.9737, "act": 0.9958, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "None of the listed options match the equation as stated. For \\[ x^4+x+1+\\sqrt{2x^2+x+5}=x^2-3x+13, \\] the real roots in ascending order are approximately: \\[ [-2.173,\\ 1.492] \\]", "expert_answer": "None of the listed options match the equation as stated.\n\nFor  \n\\[\nx^4+x+1+\\sqrt{2x^2+x+5}=x^2-3x+13,\n\\]\nthe real roots in ascending order are approximately:\n\n\\[\n[-2.173,\\ 1.492]\n\\]", "transcript": "Finding all the real roots of the equation dollar x to the fourth plus plus one plus sqrt 2x plus x plus 5, x squared minus 3x plus 13 dollars. Return the answer as a list with ascending order. A, 0.280764, 1.786404. B, minus 2.28064, 1.2864. C, 1.7807492 or point 3. D, E, 2. F, 0.28064, 2.7804.\n", "asr_s": 1.51, "expert_s": 29.1, "expert_input_samples