{"id": "q0495", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 232739410, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "67ad139c11ad192120e00f1f4cc28f36ec4dc2a78471efa94476f5caf342cabc", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 0, "query": "创建一个程序将动物分类到不同的组中。", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0495.wav", "input_sha256": "7b886e4768c29eb5cc29c2f6d4325794a5bbd188bb170da8d0c4e8eea3c8f8a4", "input_samples": 63400, "input_s": 3.962, "n_real_chunks": 4, "score": 0.3079, "act": 0.998, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "下面是一个简单的 Python 程序，可以根据动物名称将其分类到不同组中： 示例运行：", "expert_answer": "下面是一个简单的 **Python 程序**，可以根据动物名称将其分类到不同组中：\n\n```python\n# 动物分类程序\n\nanimal_groups = {\n    \"哺乳动物\": [\"狗\", \"猫\", \"老虎\", \"狮子\", \"大象\", \"猴子\"],\n    \"鸟类\": [\"麻雀\", \"老鹰\", \"鸽子\", \"企鹅\", \"孔雀\"],\n    \"鱼类\": [\"鲤鱼\", \"鲨鱼\", \"金鱼\", \"三文鱼\"],\n    \"爬行动物\": [\"蛇\", \"乌龟\", \"鳄鱼\", \"蜥蜴\"],\n    \"两栖动物\": [\"青蛙\", \"蟾蜍\", \"蝾螈\"],\n    \"昆虫\": [\"蚂蚁\", \"蜜蜂\", \"蝴蝶\", \"蚊子\"]\n}\n\ndef classify_animal(animal):\n    for group, animals in animal_groups.items():\n        if animal in animals:\n            return group\n    return \"未知类别\"\n\n# 用户输入\nanimal = input(\"请输入动物名称：\")\n\n# 输出分类结果\ngroup = classify_animal(animal)\nprint(f\"{animal} 属于：{group}\")\n```\n\n示例运行：\n\n```text\n请输入动物名称：老虎\n老虎 属于：哺乳动物\n```\n\n```text\n请输入动物名称：青蛙\n青蛙 属于：两栖动物\n```", "transcript": "创建一个程序，将动物分类到不同的组中。\n", "asr_s": 1.09, "expert_s": 5.26, "expert_input_samples": 63400, "expert_input_s": 3.962, "expert_input_sha256": "7b886e4768c29eb5cc29c2f6d4325794a5bbd188bb170da8d0c4e8eea3c8f8a4", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 4.908, "relay_synth_ms": 4071, "onset_chunk": 4, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 1, "feed_lag_max_ms": 99, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 99, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0495_always_relay.wav", "sha256": "e926463ada8b0ca2f6ce4982a7bdf1fbb68b4eff70e2c9661ea2a60b383a3ca1", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 7.12}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0495_always_candidate.wav", "sha256": "36b274f74e35d2bdb1add1e3fde13e79e2c8bbd78959c1d3af9e23c26e2be2bb", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0495_always_stall.wav", "sha256": "d70cc06ebd1ad434072493fbe4a46e8b03350856e96f1d541b562c6b1b171b1e", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 2.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.072, 1.131, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.075, 2.132, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.074, 3.133, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 3.962, 4.038, 4.1, 1, 0, 0], [4, 0, 4.963, 5.038, 5.455, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.963, 6.134, 6.903, 0, 30720, 1]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 3.962, "last_real_feed_done": 4.038, "onset": 5.455, "gate_read_done": 5.455, "fire": 5.455, "candidate_first_pcm": 5.455, "stall_note": 5.456, "stall_first_pcm": 6.062, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 6.903, "expert_req": 5.456, "expert_resp": 11.811, "relay_synth_start": 11.812, "relay_first_pcm": 12.675, "relay_synth_end": 15.884, "first_any_pcm": 5.455, "first_answer_pcm": 12.675, "session_end": 16.036}, "ttfa_answer_s": 8.713, "ttfa_any_s": 1.493}
